Package: wheather
Title: Compare Weather Quality Across Years
Version: 0.1.5
Authors@R:
    person("Pete", "O", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "pete@example.com")
Description: Was this summer's weather actually better than last year's?
    Fetches historical weather data from the Open-Meteo API (free, no key
    required), scores each day's "goodness" on a 0-100 scale using
    configurable weights (temperature, rain, sky, humidity, wind),
    and compares periods across years with statistical
    tests. Includes a Shiny app for interactive exploration.
